    "description": "Sri Lanka\u2019s crisis is not just about debt \u2013 it\u2019s about accountability",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/opinion/Sri-Lanka-s-crisis-is-not-just-about-debt-it-s-about-accountability/14-793448",
