    "date_str": "2026-06-18",
    "description": "Beruwala Boat Launching Ramp a milestone for boat-building industry: CMISL",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Beruwala-Boat-Launching-Ramp-a-milestone-for-boat-building-industry-CMISL/56-793460",
    "lang": "en",
