    "chunk_text": "Sugeeshwara Bandara arrested\n\nColombo, June 18 (Daily Mirror) - The leader of the New People\u2019s Front, Sugeeshwara Bandara, has been arrested by the Central Crime Investigation Bureau (CCIB), police said.\n\nHe was taken into custody in connection with an ongoing investigation into allegations that he received salaries from two separate government institutions.\n\nAuthorities said the arrest follows inquiries into possible irregularities related to dual salary payments. Further investigations are currently underway."
