    "chunk_text": "Softlogic Life enters Bangladesh with US$ 1.9mn insurer acquisition\n\nSoftlogic Life Insurance PLC yesterday announced it has signed a share purchase agreement to acquire a 60 percent stake in Bangladesh-based Diamond Life Insurance Company Limited for approximately US$1.9 million, marking the Sri Lankan insurer\u2019s entry into the Bangladesh life insurance market.\n\nThe company disclosed to the Colombo Stock Exchange (CSE) that the acquisition forms part of its regional expansion strategy and would provide a foothold in one of South Asia\u2019s largest and fastest-growing insurance markets.\n\n\u201cThe acquisition is in line with the Company\u2019s regional expansion strategy and represents entry into the Bangladesh life insurance market,\u201d Chairman Ashok Pathirage said in the filing.\n\nThe company said further disclosures would be made upon completion of the transaction. Financial and regulatory approvals, if required, were not detailed in the announcement."
