    "description": "Beyond the IMF: Why Sri Lanka needs a national vision, strong institutions and effective economic diplomacy",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Beyond-the-IMF-Why-Sri-Lanka-needs-a-national-vision-strong-institutions-and-effective-economic-diplomacy/4-793510",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
