    "chunk_text": "Over 40 arrested in Walana STF raid on massage centres\n\nColombo, June 19 (Daily Mirror) - A total of 43 individuals have been arrested following a series of raids carried out by the Walana Central Anti-Vice Strike Force on massage centres in the Thalawathugoda area.\n\nAccordingly, nine establishments were targeted during the operation, which allegedly uncovered brothels operating under the guise of massage centres.\n\nA total of 43 people, including 34 women, were taken into custody during the raids."
