    "chunk_size_bytes": 1347,
    "chunk_text": "The Mahindra Bolero Off\u2011Road Rally, reserved for Mahindra Bolero customers, was another highlight of the event. The celebrations concluded with a free musical concert that drew a large crowd, underscoring the success and popularity of the programme.\u00a0 \u00a0The creator of the Ideal Abiyogaya programme, Ideal Motors Group Founder and Chairman Nalin Welgama shared his thoughts on the journey his company has come so far, the Ideal Abiyogaya programme and Ideal Sewana programmes planned for the future.\n\nHe added, \u201cAccordingly, I introduced a new programme in Sri Lanka called the Ideal Abiyogaya. Through this initiative, the Mahindra vehicle users were offered a range of competitions, assessments of their vehicles and the unique opportunity to enjoy a free musical concert by one of the most popular bands in the country, an experience many had never had before.\u201d\n\nSpeaking on future plans, he noted, \u201cWe aim to introduce several new features to the Ideal Abiyogaya programme. Among them is Ideal Sewana, designed to provide solutions for those facing financial challenges. In addition, the Ideal Abiyogaya initiative will continue to prioritise improvements in health and education. Ideal Motors is also pleased to announce that the 11th phase of Ideal Abiyogaya will be launched soon, focusing on another vibrant region of Sri Lanka.\u201d"
