    "chunk_text": "The creator of the Ideal Abiyogaya program, Nalin Welgama, Founder and Chairman, Ideal Motors Group, shared his thoughts on the journey his company has come so far, the Ideal Abiyogaya program, and the \u2018Ideal Sewana\u2019 programs planned for the future.\n\nHe added, \u201cAccordingly, I introduced a new program in Sri Lanka called the Ideal Abiyogaya. Through this initiative, Mahindra vehicle users were offered a range of competitions, assessments of their vehicles, and the unique opportunity to enjoy a free musical concert by one of the most popular bands in the country, an experience many had never had before.\u201d\n\nSpeaking on future plans, he noted, \u2018We aim to introduce several new features to the Ideal Abiyogaya program. Among them is Ideal Sewana, designed to provide solutions for those facing financial challenges. In addition, the Ideal Abiyogaya initiative will continue to prioritize improvements in health and education. Ideal Motors is also pleased to announce that the 11th phase of Ideal Abiyogaya will be launched soon, focusing on another vibrant region of Sri Lanka.\u201d\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
