    "description": "\u201cOne more such victory and we are done for\u201d \u2013 King Pyrrhus of Epirus, in 279 B.C.",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/one-more-such-victory-and-we-are-done-for-king-pyrrhus-of-epirus-in-279-b-c/",
