    "chunk_size_bytes": 1243,
    "chunk_text": "CEAT opens premium Shop-in-Shop outlet at Olympic Tyre House, Colombo 6\n\nCEAT Kelani Holdings has expanded its network of premium retail outlets with the opening of a new Shop-in-Shop (SIS) facility at Olympic Tyre House located at No. 255, Havelock Road, Colombo 6, strengthening the brand\u2019s presence in one of the capital\u2019s busiest commercial areas.\n\nStrategically located opposite Havelock City Mall, the new outlet offers vehicle owners convenient access to CEAT\u2019s full range of tyre solutions in a modern, customer-friendly retail environment. The facility provides an extensive range of CEAT tyres at attractive discounts alongside a comprehensive portfolio of tyre-related services including nitrogen and air inflation, wheel balancing and wheel alignment. A dedicated customer lounge has also been incorporated into the outlet to provide added comfort while vehicles are being attended to.\n\nPrime Residencies forges ahead with construction of MON VIE, Colombo 05\n\nSri Lanka and Russia forge path to enhanced tourism ties at Moscow Forum\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
