    "description": "Sacrificing Autonomy- Penny Wise, Pound Foolish: Maritime Security Cooperation with India",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/Sacrificing-Autonomy-Penny-Wise-Pound-Foolish-Maritime-Security-Cooperation-with-India/172-343544",
    "lang": "en",
