    "description": "Mujibur accuses Govt. of using Middle East crisis to justify fuel price hikes despite adequate stocks",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Mujibur-accuses-Govt-of-using-Middle-East-crisis-to-justify-fuel-price-hikes-despite-adequate-stocks/56-793608",
    "lang": "en",
