    "description": "Fix domestic environment before marketing it to global investors, urges Ajit Gunewardene",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Fix-domestic-environment-before-marketing-it-to-global-investors-urges-Ajit-Gunewardene/273-343621",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
