    "description": "Pentagon seeks $80 billion from congress for Iran War amid peace talks",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Pentagon-seeks-80-billion-from-congress-for-Iran-War-amid-peace-talks/108-343659",
