    "chunk_text": "Given the situation, health officials urged the public to remain vigilant for dengue symptoms, including high fever, severe headache, pain behind the eyes, muscle and joint pain, nausea, vomiting, skin rashes and unusual bleeding.\n\nThe public has also been urged to eliminate mosquito breeding sites by removing stagnant water from containers, cleaning gutters and drains, covering water storage tanks, disposing of discarded items that collect rainwater and using mosquito repellents, long-sleeved clothing and window screens to reduce the risk of mosquito bites."
