    "chunk_text": "Market breadth weakened considerably, with 151 decliners outweighing 49 gainers, underscoring the broad-based selling pressure and subdued investor sentiment. HNB.N emerged as the largest positive contributor to the ASPI, adding 5.62 points, followed by VPEL.N, LOLC.N, PKME.N and ASCO.N. Meanwhile, JKH.N exerted the biggest drag on the index, shaving off 11.00 points, while SPEN.N, DFCC.N, COMB.N and ACL.N also weighed on overall market performance."
